      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Guía para la inversión \nen la implementación \ndigital (DIIG):\nincorporación de intervenciones digitales  \nen los programas de salud\n\nb\n\nGuía para la inversión \nen la implementación \ndigital (DIIG):\nincorporación de intervenciones digitales \nen los programas de salud\n\nGuía para la inversión en la implementación digital (DIIG): incorporación de intervenciones digitales en los programas de salud \n[Digital implementation investment guide (DIIG): integrating digital interventions into health programmes]\nISBN 978-92-4-004757-0 (versión electrónica)\nISBN 978-92-4-004758-7 (versión impresa)\n© Organiza",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The full Spanish edition of WHO's Digital implementation investment guide (DIIG), on incorporating digital interventions into health programmes, extracted as one block. It begins with the 2022 copyright and licence page, ISBNs and suggested citation. The guide, as indicated by the start and end shown, takes health programme planners through steps from goal-setting and analysing system needs to selecting, budgeting and implementing digital interventions. It concludes with a logic model template for mapping inputs, processes, outputs, outcomes and impact with indicators.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
      }
